{
  "key": "pr-1634",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "gh-1633 fix(anthropic): accept SSE frames without event: lines",
    "description": "Closes #1633.\n\n`_handleSseEvent` skipped every frame whose SSE `event:` field was missing, so Anthropic-compatible proxies that stream bare `data: {\"type\":...}` frames (PostNL Bedrock proxy) produced an empty response. The event name now falls back to the JSON `type` when `event:` is absent or the SSE default `message`; `[DONE]` and non-JSON frames are skipped.\n\nTests: `dart test test/providers/anthropic_test.dart` (text and tool_use streams without `event:` lines)."
  }
}

